# Day File Convention

Every new **numbered** day of the 100 day series must follow this pattern.

**Next day is Day 43.** Continue Day 42, then Day 43, Day 44, … Day 100. Files:

```
days/day43.html
days/day44.html
...
days/day100.html
```

Do **not** add more Python bonus days. Python 1 to 9 is finished. See `python-bonus.mdc`.

## ADK stays after Day 38. Do not shift it.

`days/adk.html` is **Building Agentic AI with ADK**. It sits after Day 38 and before Day 39. Keep that chapter as it is. Do not rewrite it, delete it, or move it below Day 39.

Place each new numbered day **after ADK**, at the end of the include list:

```html
<div data-include='days/day38.html'></div>
<div data-include='days/adk.html'></div>
<div data-include='days/day39.html'></div>
<div data-include='days/day40.html'></div>
<div data-include='days/day41.html'></div>
<div data-include='days/day42.html'></div>
<div data-include='days/day43.html'></div>
```

Sidebar TOC: new Day N block after the previous numbered day (Day 42, then 43, …), **after** the ADK block. Hero and footer become "Day N of 100 published".

Day 43 lesson numbers start at Day 42's last lesson plus 1. **Do not shift ADK.** See `lesson-numbering.mdc`.

## 1. Create the day file

The file contains **only** the chapter-divider and lesson-card blocks.

```html
      <div class="chapter-divider reveal" id="chapter-day-43" data-chapter="day-43">
        <span class="chapter-divider__pill">Day 43</span>
        <h2 class="chapter-divider__title">Your Day Title Here</h2>
        <p class="chapter-divider__note">Short description of the day.</p>
      </div>

      <article class="lesson-card reveal" id="section-N" data-section="N" data-chapter="day-43">
        ...
      </article>
```

## 2. Add the placeholder in index.html

Inside `<main>`, add exactly one include after the previous numbered day (after ADK and Day 42):

```html
      <div data-include='days/day43.html'></div>
```

**Never add new day content inline in index.html.**

## 3. What still goes in index.html

- Sidebar TOC for the new day (after the ADK TOC block, after the previous numbered day)
- Hero and footer "Day N of 100 published"

## 4. What still goes in styles.css

```css
.chapter-divider[data-chapter="day-43"] { border-left-color: var(--chapter-day-43); }
.lesson-card[data-chapter="day-43"] { border-top-color: var(--chapter-day-43); }
```

After any `styles.css` change, run `embed-css.sh`.

## 5. Checklist

- [ ] `days/dayN.html` created with chapter-divider and lesson-cards
- [ ] Include added after the previous numbered day, after ADK
- [ ] Sidebar TOC added after the ADK block
- [ ] Hero and footer day count updated
- [ ] CSS color rules added; `embed-css.sh` run if CSS changed
- [ ] ADK chapter left after Day 38 and not rewritten or shifted
- [ ] No day content written inline in `index.html`
